      "title": "Seven tools. Your Windows workflow.",
      "excerpt": "Practical PowerShell tools by Janne Vuorela for books, PDFs, videos, podcasts, recordings and images. Download a tool, set up its dependencies, and run it on your own computer.",
      "template": "",
      "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"home-intro\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group home-intro\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Practical PowerShell tools by Janne Vuorela for books, PDFs, videos, podcasts, recordings and images. Download a tool, set up its dependencies, and run it on your own computer.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"eyebrow\">Focused tools. Local workflows. Source code on GitHub.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#tools\">Explore the tools ↓</a></div><!-- /wp:button -->\n</div><!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"lineup-head\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group lineup-head\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE TOOLKIT</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"anchor\":\"tools\"} --><h2 id=\"tools\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Find your next workflow.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-grid\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:winbooksplit-avatar}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"card-portrait\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full card-portrait\"><img src=\"{{asset:winbooksplit-avatar}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:winbooksplit-avatar}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"card-index\"} --><p class=\"card-index\">01 / WinBookSplit</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{page:winbooksplit}}\">WinBookSplit</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Turn a large book into focused chapters.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:winpdfmerger-avatar}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"card-portrait\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full card-portrait\"><img src=\"{{asset:winpdfmerger-avatar}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:winpdfmerger-avatar}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"card-index\"} --><p class=\"card-index\">02 / WinPDFMerger</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{page:winpdfmerger}}\">WinPDFMerger</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bring your PDFs together.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:winvidcompress-avatar}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"card-portrait\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full card-portrait\"><img src=\"{{asset:winvidcompress-avatar}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:winvidcompress-avatar}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"card-index\"} --><p class=\"card-index\">03 / WinVidCompress</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{page:winvidcompress}}\">WinVidCompress</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Make a viewing copy. Keep the original.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:universalpodcastdownloader-avatar}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"card-portrait\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full card-portrait\"><img src=\"{{asset:universalpodcastdownloader-avatar}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:universalpodcastdownloader-avatar}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"card-index\"} --><p class=\"card-index\">04 / UniversalPodcastDownloader</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{page:universalpodcastdownloader}}\">UniversalPodcastDownloader</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Keep your listening library close.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:winaudioclean-avatar}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"card-portrait\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full card-portrait\"><img src=\"{{asset:winaudioclean-avatar}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:winaudioclean-avatar}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"card-index\"} --><p class=\"card-index\">05 / WinAudioClean</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{page:winaudioclean}}\">WinAudioClean</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Give spoken audio a cleaner finish.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:winimagenormalizer-avatar}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"card-portrait\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full card-portrait\"><img src=\"{{asset:winimagenormalizer-avatar}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:winimagenormalizer-avatar}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"card-index\"} --><p class=\"card-index\">06 / WinImageNormalizer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{page:winimagenormalizer}}\">WinImageNormalizer</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bring a mixed image folder into focus.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-card\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:audiofileforphone-avatar}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"card-portrait\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full card-portrait\"><img src=\"{{asset:audiofileforphone-avatar}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:audiofileforphone-avatar}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"card-index\"} --><p class=\"card-index\">07 / AudioFileForPhone</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{page:audiofileforphone}}\">AudioFileForPhone</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Pack more listening into your phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n",
