      "id": "universalpodcastdownloader",
      "slug": "universalpodcastdownloader",
      "title": "UniversalPodcastDownloader",
      "excerpt": "Download podcast audio from RSS and Atom feeds to your Windows computer. Choose the latest episode, a selected count or the accessible feed catalogue.",
      "template": "templates/tool.php",
      "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-hero\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-hero\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-copy\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-copy\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:universalpodcastdownloader-icon}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"tool-icon\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full tool-icon\"><img src=\"{{asset:universalpodcastdownloader-icon}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:universalpodcastdownloader-icon}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tagline\"} --><p class=\"tagline\">Keep your listening library close.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"description\"} --><p class=\"description\">Download podcast audio from RSS and Atom feeds to your Windows computer. Choose the latest episode, a selected count or the accessible feed catalogue.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://github.com/PikkuJanne/UniversalPodcastDownloader/releases/tag/v1.0.0\">Download v1.0.0</a></div><!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://github.com/PikkuJanne/UniversalPodcastDownloader/blob/v1.0.0/README.md\">Source &amp; instructions</a></div><!-- /wp:button -->\n</div><!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{attachment:universalpodcastdownloader-character}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"tool-art\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full tool-art\"><img src=\"{{asset:universalpodcastdownloader-character}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-{{attachment:universalpodcastdownloader-character}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-section tool-benefits\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-section tool-benefits\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What it does</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Keep original audio without transcoding.</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item --><li>Verify previously downloaded files before skipping them.</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item --><li>Save shows for repeat or batch downloads.</li><!-- /wp:list-item -->\n</ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-section tool-requirements\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-section tool-requirements\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Requirements</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Windows 11; Windows PowerShell 5.1 or supported PowerShell 7; writable output storage and internet access to feed/media hosts. No FFmpeg or Python dependency.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-section tool-start\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-section tool-start\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Get started</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Extract the ZIP with the complete <code>src</code> directory. Open <code>UniversalPodcastDownloader.bat</code>, enter a feed or supported show-page URL, then choose latest, count or all.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tool-section tool-limits\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tool-section tool-limits\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Output & limits</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Audio, download history and logs in organized show folders; default root is Downloads/Podcasts. Audio includes supported MP3, M4A, Ogg, WAV and FLAC. “All” means the bounded accessible catalogue, not every historical episode. Provider feeds and discovery conventions vary; browser-session imports are unsupported.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tool-return\"} --><p class=\"tool-return\"><a href=\"{{page:home}}#tools\">&larr; Back to all tools</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
